Satisficing Licensing and Attribution Note
==========================================

The Satisficing package is licensed as a whole under the GNU General Public
License, version 2 or later (GPL >= 2), as declared in DESCRIPTION:
    License: GPL (>= 2)

Note on GPL Full Text Location:
-------------------------------
The repository-level GPL text file (LICENSE.md) is excluded from R source
distribution tarballs via .Rbuildignore. The complete text of the GPL is
available online in the upstream repository:
    https://github.com/soheidon/Satisficing/blob/main/LICENSE.md
or directly from the Free Software Foundation:
    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html

Included Third-Party Component: 'careless'
------------------------------------------
Satisficing incorporates functions, datasets, and documentation ported from the
R package 'careless' (version 1.2.2), originally authored by Richard Yentes and
Francisco Wilhelm, licensed under the MIT License:

    Copyright (c) 2016 Richard Yentes

The full MIT License text for the ported careless components is available in:
- Source tree: inst/licenses/careless-MIT.txt
- Installed package: licenses/careless-MIT.txt

Detailed copyright attribution and component inventory are documented in:
- Source tree: inst/COPYRIGHTS
- Installed package: COPYRIGHTS

Satisficing is an independent package and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
the original authors of the 'careless' package.
